message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "BioXplain: an empirical study of explanation stability and cross-cohort replication in breast-tissue gene expression"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Baig
    given-names: Hira
repository-code: "https://github.com/hiramustafabaig/BioXplain"
abstract: "An empirical study and tested, reproducible Python workflow measuring how consistently machine-learning explanations identify gene-expression features across resampling, model and explainer, and whether that stability predicts replication in an independent breast-tissue cohort. A student research-portfolio project, not peer reviewed."
keywords:
  - explanation stability
  - feature selection stability
  - gene expression
  - SHAP
  - breast cancer
  - reproducibility
